### `333 serve`: reaching a verdict about one of this node's own epochs, once.

hours-judging-failed-reading = reading this node's own record: { $why }
    .keyword = failed

hours-judging-failed = judging epoch { $epoch }: { $why }
    .keyword = failed

hours-judging-judged = epoch { $epoch }: { $verdict }
    .keyword = judged

hours-judging-record = { $answered }
    .keyword = record

hours-judging-present = present. it will not be judged again.
hours-judging-absent = absent. everyone drawn to ask you has sworn nothing came back. it will
    not be judged again.
hours-judging-none-drawn = outside the count. nobody was drawn to ask you, and an epoch that asked
    nothing of you takes nothing from you.
hours-judging-receipt-withdrew = outside the count. you kept the question and the answer you gave to it,
    which withdraws the accusation without earning a presence.
hours-judging-not-all-spoke = outside the count. some of those drawn said nothing at all, and silence
    is not agreement.
